{"id":"t8nzzu63tmh6rauoe3wy4lz8w","title":"为什么正确的科学理论离不开严谨的数学逻辑","originalTitle":null,"summary":"本文指出，现代科学界存在敌视数学逻辑的现象，根源在于认知失败后的心理防御。正确的科学理论依赖严格的数学推导，而错误理论可分为公式正确理解错误和公式本身错误两类。刘跃教授通过数学与物理原理的双重验证，揭示了“阻抗匹配理论”的错误，强调了数学语言在排除自然语言歧义中的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3589443&do=blog&id=1560134"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T04:39:09.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T11:25:34.953Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T11:25:34.953Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"6de25329-6be9-472a-95a2-7c5eecac587a","title":"刘跃教授提出错误理论两分法并批判阻抗匹配理论"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"6de25329-6be9-472a-95a2-7c5eecac587a","title":"刘跃教授提出错误理论两分法并批判阻抗匹配理论"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fsjWwodYceTI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}